-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"silver-scimitar\" title=\"Silver Scimitar - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f695e1344db9a5e88aae.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Silver Scimitar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-dagger\" title=\"Gold Dagger - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/269b85f477087ff1c8e4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Dagger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Crude: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>⭐ Elite loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"ogrewax-knick\" title=\"Ogrewax Knick - in 17 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b734a810757d0d5d1409.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Knick</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"scroll-fireball\" title=\"Scroll Fireball - in 1 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b66cd8cfb8dcdd17e1d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Scroll Fireball</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/17<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link elite\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 2 of 17 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/9<br>×1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Ogre Den</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 129</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-57\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><figure class=\"wp-inset\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><div class=\"wp-inset-map\" style=\"transform:translate(350.8px,-410.4px)\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-3/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-768px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-2/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-512px;top:512px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/1.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:256px\"><img src=\"wtiles/1/-1/2.png\" alt=\"\" style=\"left:-256px;top:512px\"><i style=\"left:-338.5px;top:401.6px\"></i><i style=\"left:-360.5px;top:415.1px\"></i><i style=\"left:-365.7px;top:418.0px\"></i></div><figcaption>Ogre Den</figcaption></figure><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Ogre%20Den\">Ogre Den</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 4 spots</span></li><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Plymouth%20Wharf\">Plymouth Wharf</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 1 spot</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"ogre\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(3)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/grumbo\"><img src=\"data/img/2e16a0e229a12336b2d0.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Grumbo</b><span>Lv 35</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-mage\"><img src=\"data/img/a08797079da143885953.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Ogre Mage</b><span>Lv 33–40</span></a><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/ogre-traitor\"><img src=\"data/img/6c240bdea4103383ba68.we